[{"_1":2},"llms/index",{"_3":4},"data","# Brokspace\n\n\n- **Start**\n- [Introduction](/docs): Brokspace makes any development workspace searchable and agent-ready, on your machine.\n- [Getting started with Brokspace](/docs/getting-started): From zero to a productive workspace in about 15 minutes.\n\n- **Guides**\n- [Local LLM setup](/docs/local-llm): Brokspace answers questions (brok ask) and runs skills (brok skill run) with any OpenAI-compatible model.\n- [Skills](/docs/skills): A skill is a small, reusable workflow written for AI agents: a folder with a SKILL.md (YAML frontmatter name + description, then instructions) and optional reference files.\n- [Shards](/docs/shards): Shards are small programs that react to workspace events.\n- [Integrations](/docs/integrations): Brokspace stays small and plugs into the tools you already use.\n\n- **Brokspace IDE**\n- [Brokspace IDE](/docs/ide): An IDE with Brokspace built in, for IDE mode next to the brok CLI.\n\n- **Ecosystem**\n- [Shard Hub (preview)](/docs/hub): The official home of shards, skills and agents for Brokspace.\n\n- **Reference**\n- [Configuration reference](/docs/configuration): Changes take effect on the next command (or after restarting brok run).\n- [Architecture](/docs/architecture): This document explains how the pieces of Brokspace fit together.\n\n# Brokspace\n\n\n- **Início**\n- [Introdução](/pt-br/docs): O Brokspace deixa qualquer workspace de desenvolvimento pesquisável e pronto para agentes, na sua máquina.\n- [Getting started with Brokspace](/pt-br/docs/getting-started): From zero to a productive workspace in about 15 minutes.\n\n- **Guias**\n- [Local LLM setup](/pt-br/docs/local-llm): Brokspace answers questions (brok ask) and runs skills (brok skill run) with any OpenAI-compatible model.\n- [Skills](/pt-br/docs/skills): A skill is a small, reusable workflow written for AI agents: a folder with a SKILL.md (YAML frontmatter name + description, then instructions) and optional reference files.\n- [Shards](/pt-br/docs/shards): Shards are small programs that react to workspace events.\n- [Integrations](/pt-br/docs/integrations): Brokspace stays small and plugs into the tools you already use.\n\n- **Brokspace IDE**\n- [Brokspace IDE](/pt-br/docs/ide): Uma IDE com o Brokspace embutido, para o modo IDE ao lado da CLI brok.\n\n- **Ecossistema**\n- [Shard Hub (prévia)](/pt-br/docs/hub): A casa oficial de shards, skills e agentes para o Brokspace.\n\n- **Referência**\n- [Configuration reference](/pt-br/docs/configuration): Changes take effect on the next command (or after restarting brok run).\n- [Architecture](/pt-br/docs/architecture): This document explains how the pieces of Brokspace fit together."]
